  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7dba48b4d30647378edde322a63d13ee, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Shooter.Game::Shooter.Game.Llm.SystemPromptSpec
  content: 'Your primary memory is the transcript of your session. It is never erased,
    but it can be compressed when it becomes too large.


    You also have Notes.
    You have full control over your Notes. The notes are fully persistent; they are
    never deleted and never automatically compressed. You should save everything
    important in your Notes.


    Notes consist of a set of files. Each file has
    a name and a brief description that are visible when retrieving the list of notes.
    To access a file''s content, you must read the file.'
